{"seq":2,"slug":"cardinality-challenges","title":"高基数挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/cardinality-challenges","wordCount":1376,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高基数挑战\">高基数挑战</h1><p>凌晨三点 Prometheus 被 OOM Killer 杀掉，复盘发现根因竟是某次发布把 <code>pod_name</code> 这种每次部署都变的标识加进了某个指标的标签——序列数一夜从几十万飙到几千万，索引撑爆内存。高基数（high cardinality）是时序系统最经典、最致命、也最容易自己作死的故障类型。它的根源在 <a href=\"../foundations/timeseries-data-model\">时序数据模型：度量、标签与字段</a> 提到的「序列数是各标签基数的连乘」。本篇专门剖析高基数为何拖垮系统、怎么诊断、怎么治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基数指不同序列的总数。每条序列由 metric name + 一组确定标签值唯一确定，序列数随标签基数连乘膨胀。高基数之所以致命，是因为时序库要为每条序列维护倒排索引项、内存中的序列状态、以及（对部分系统）独立的存储分片——这些开销都与序列数线性甚至超线性相关。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[加入高基数标签] --&gt; B[序列数连乘爆炸]&#10;  B --&gt; C[倒排索引膨胀&lt;br/&gt;内存耗尽]&#10;  B --&gt; D[每序列状态开销&lt;br/&gt;memtable膨胀]&#10;  B --&gt; E[小序列碎片化&lt;br/&gt;压缩率下降]&#10;  C --&gt; F[OOM / 查询变慢]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[治理: 移除/归一化/限流]\">graph TD\n  A[加入高基数标签] --&gt; B[序列数连乘爆炸]\n  B --&gt; C[倒排索引膨胀&lt;br/&gt;内存耗尽]\n  B --&gt; D[每序列状态开销&lt;br/&gt;memtable膨胀]\n  B --&gt; E[小序列碎片化&lt;br/&gt;压缩率下降]\n  C --&gt; F[OOM / 查询变慢]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[治理: 移除/归一化/限流]</pre><p>下表是高基数典型「肇事标签」清单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>肇事标签</th>\n<th>为何危险</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>user_id / 客户 ID</td>\n<td>基数随用户无界增长</td>\n<td>不入标签，或聚合后统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>request_id / trace_id</td>\n<td>每请求唯一，基数爆炸</td>\n<td>放日志/追踪系统，不入指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pod_name（含随机后缀）</td>\n<td>每次部署都变</td>\n<td>用 deployment 名等稳定标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整 URL / 路径</td>\n<td>含可变参数，基数巨大</td>\n<td>归一化为路由模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳/IP 当标签</td>\n<td>几乎无限取值</td>\n<td>时间是主轴、IP 做字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为何高基数拖垮系统\">为何高基数拖垮系统</h2><p>序列数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{series} = \\prod_i \\lvert tag_i \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是连乘，新增一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 取值的标签就把序列数乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。系统资源消耗大致随序列数线性增长：</p>\n<p>倒排索引要为每个「标签值 → 序列集合」维护映射，序列越多映射项越多，索引内存占用近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N_{series})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每条活跃序列在内存表里还有自己的状态（最近值、压缩上下文），又是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N_{series})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。高基数下这两项叠加可轻易吃光内存。</p>\n<p>更隐蔽的伤害是碎片化：高基数意味着大量序列每个只有寥寥几个点。<a href=\"../storage/compression-tsdb\">时序压缩：Gorilla 与 Delta</a> 依赖「同序列大量连续相似值」才高效，短序列既压不动又摊不薄索引开销，压缩率与摄取吞吐双双恶化。Prometheus 对此尤其敏感，因为它把序列状态都放内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诊断-找出基数从哪来\">诊断:找出基数从哪来</h2><p>治理前先定位。各系统提供基数审视工具：Prometheus 可查 <code>prometheus_tsdb_head_series</code>（当前活跃序列数）与按 metric/label 的基数分布（<code>/api/v1/status/tsdb</code> 的 topN）；InfluxDB 有 <code>SHOW SERIES CARDINALITY</code>、<code>SHOW TAG VALUES</code>；TimescaleDB 可用普通 SQL 对维度列做 <code>COUNT(DISTINCT)</code>。</p>\n<p>诊断的关键问题有三：哪个 metric 贡献最多序列？哪个 label 的基数最高？基数是稳定还是在持续增长（增长型最危险，往往是误把可变 ID 当标签）？把这些量化成可监控的指标本身,就能在爆炸前告警——这正是 <a href=\"monitoring-iot-uses\">监控与 IoT 应用</a> 里「监控你的监控」的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理手段\">治理手段</h2><p>诊断出问题后，治理手段从源头到运行时分层展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>源头建模：遵守 <a href=\"../foundations/timeseries-data-model\">时序数据模型：度量、标签与字段</a> 的纪律，高基数维度一律不进标签。这是最根本、成本最低的防线。</li>\n<li>归一化：把 <code>/users/12345/profile</code> 这类路径归一化为 <code>/users/:id/profile</code> 路由模板，URL 基数从无限降到路由数。</li>\n<li>标签丢弃/重标记：Prometheus 的 relabel 配置可在摄取前 drop 或改写危险标签。</li>\n<li>限流与配额：对每租户/每 metric 设序列数上限，超限拒绝新序列，防止单点拖垮全局。</li>\n<li>切换存储模型：把高基数维度从「标签」降为「字段」或移到日志/追踪系统——日志天生适合高基数的离散事件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下表对比治理手段的代价与效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>生效阶段</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建模避免</td>\n<td>设计期</td>\n<td>需前瞻</td>\n<td>根治</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化</td>\n<td>摄取期</td>\n<td>需维护规则</td>\n<td>大幅降基数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>relabel 丢弃</td>\n<td>摄取期</td>\n<td>丢失部分维度</td>\n<td>立竿见影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列配额</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>可能丢数据</td>\n<td>兜底保护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"架构层面的缓解\">架构层面的缓解</h2><p>当业务确实需要高基数分析（如按用户分析），单靠建模收敛不够，要在架构上分流。常见做法是「指标库 + 分析库」分工：低基数聚合指标留在 Prometheus/InfluxDB 做实时告警，高基数明细导入 ClickHouse 等列式分析库做离线下钻。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"tsdb-products\">产品：InfluxDB、Prometheus、TimescaleDB</a> 提到的 2026 多库组合趋势一致。另一个方向是采用对高基数更友好的引擎——列式分析库不为每序列维护内存状态,而是按列扫描,高基数下退化更平缓。无论哪条路，核心思想都是「不要让高基数数据进那个为低基数优化的系统」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>基数是序列总数，随标签基数连乘膨胀，是时序系统最致命且最易自伤的故障源。</li>\n<li>高基数让倒排索引与每序列内存状态线性膨胀致 OOM，并因短序列碎片化拖垮压缩与摄取。</li>\n<li>头号肇事标签：user_id、request_id、含随机后缀的 pod_name、完整 URL、IP/时间戳。</li>\n<li>诊断靠各系统的基数统计工具，重点找最大贡献 metric/label 及增长趋势。</li>\n<li>治理分层：源头建模避免、路径归一化、relabel 丢弃、序列配额，架构上用「指标库+分析库」分流高基数明细。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高基数挑战","id":"高基数挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为何高基数拖垮系统","id":"为何高基数拖垮系统"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断:找出基数从哪来","id":"诊断-找出基数从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"治理手段","id":"治理手段"},{"level":2,"text":"架构层面的缓解","id":"架构层面的缓解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"产品：InfluxDB、Prometheus、TimescaleDB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/tsdb-products"},"next":{"title":"监控与 IoT 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/systems/monitoring-iot-uses"}}